===Preposition===
{{en-prep}}

# [[apart from|Apart from]], [[except]] (for), [[excluding]].
#: {{syn|en|barring|except for|save for|Thesaurus:except}}
#: {{ux|en|Everyone '''but''' Father left early.}}
#: {{ux|en|I like everything '''but''' that.}}
#: {{ux|en|Nobody answered the door when I knocked, so I had no choice '''but''' to leave.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2011-10-23|author=Becky Ashton|work=BBC Sport
|title=[http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/eng_prem/15325522.stm QPR 1-0 Chelsea]
|passage=Luiz struggled with the movement of Helguson in the box, as he collected a long ball and the Spaniard barged him over, leaving referee Chris Foy little option '''but''' to point to the spot.}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete|outside|Scotland}} [[outside|Outside]] of.
#: {{ux|en|Away '''but''' the hoose and tell me whae's there.}}

